WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.685 --> 00:00:01.518
(clap)

00:00:01.518 --> 00:00:04.018
(silly music)

00:00:06.574 --> 00:00:08.200
- Three words, wow.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.570
- Okay, um.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.360
- Could one of the words be hyphenated?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.193
- [Interviewer] Yep.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:19.750
- Am I a Monica?

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.790
Is this a Friends test?

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:33.913
- No.

00:00:33.913 --> 00:00:35.710
- Oh, yeah, what?

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:36.790
- Oh God.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.890
Is this what it is?

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.685
I'm curious to see who my friends are.

00:00:39.685 --> 00:00:40.810
- Oh, yeah!

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.120
- Hilarious, big hearted, incredible.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:47.340
- Hilarious, genuine, and unpredictable.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.249
- Funny, kind, sing-songy.

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.710
- (laughs) That was Garrick.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.860
Garrick said sing-songy (laughs).

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.920
I wish I believed them (laughs).

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.400
- Genuine,

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.640
unstoppable, and

00:00:58.640 --> 00:00:59.590
iconic.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.240
- Unpredictable, colorful, and kind.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.470
Maybe a ho?

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:05.740
- Yes (laughs).

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:10.870
- Confident, inspiring,
beautiful inside and out.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.040
- Wow!

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.430
I have some nice friends!

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:18.460
I would never describe myself
in that many nice words.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.440
- This is the most pressure
I've ever had in my life.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.300
Funny, smart,

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.460
zesty.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.057
- Did Ryan say zesty?

00:01:26.057 --> 00:01:27.400
Who said zesty?

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.491
- Cool, artist, opinionated.

00:01:30.491 --> 00:01:33.070
- (laughs) That's true.

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:36.130
- Creative, kind, passionate.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.110
- Oh, that's very sweet.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.330
It's nice to know that
I guess other people

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.840
see you the way you see yourself.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.600
- Beautiful, genuine, and strong.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:47.710
- Goddess, angel baby, darling.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.950
- Funny, lovely, and courageous.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.310
- Considerate, intelligent, and sassy.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:03.920
- Energetic, comical, independent.

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.810
Loud, intelligent, and funny.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:07.643
Extra.

00:02:07.643 --> 00:02:08.750
- Wow!

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.940
That's the most precious
thing in the world!

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.590
Also, I'm glad they don't think I'm funny.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.720
- Hot, cool, and nerdy.

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.210
- So I'm just a lot of temperatures.

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:20.100
- Visionary, driven, and
maybe a bit of a diva.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.017
- Passionate, brilliant, and stubborn.

00:02:23.017 --> 00:02:25.330
He is so fucking stubborn.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.200
- Did fucking Zack say that?

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.160
Yeah, fucker.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.120
Can I quickly pick three
words for each of them?

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.095
Keith is waffle, pancakes, chicken.

00:02:33.095 --> 00:02:36.480
Ned is married, married, married.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.680
And then Zack is

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.750
ow,

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.000
my,

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.480
back.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.478
(laughs)

00:02:45.478 --> 00:02:47.978
(quiet music)

